{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6ab0ba7f-f95f-8a38-a592-9a06d21a0913",
  "created_at": "2026-01-22T12:39:04-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Lucia Costa",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:32:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:32:04-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise. My name's Lucia Costa. I'm calling about a storm drain in front of a house I own, on Van Zandt Avenue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:32:18-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, what's the address there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:32:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "284 Van Zandt. It's up in the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:32:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 284 Van Zandt. And what's it doing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:32:34-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's slow. It kind of grunts, you can hear it gurgling, and then the water sits. Any time we get a thaw, the snow melts and it backs up into the street and pools out in front of the walk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:32:57-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's not that it's clogged solid, it just can't keep up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:33:05-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. It does drain, eventually. But it takes hours. And there's no storm right now, I want to be clear about that. It's dry out. It's just the melt, or sometimes even a mild day, and it does it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:33:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Has it been like this a while?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:33:33-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Since I got the place, pretty much. A few years. I rent it out, I'm the landlord, so my tenants are the ones walking through it. I'm there on the weekends mostly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:33:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is the water getting onto the property, or just the street and the sidewalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:34:01-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the street and the sidewalk so far. It gets close to the bottom of the walkway. It freezes at night, too, so that's a slipping thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:34:17-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's no good. Let me put that down. Anything else you've noticed around it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:34:26-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, there's a manhole cover near it. Maybe ten feet up toward the corner. It looks off by an inch or so. Like it's not sitting flat. I don't know if it's connected, but I figured I'd mention it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:34:49-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is it sticking up, or sunk down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:34:54-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sticking up a little on one side. Cars go over it and you can hear it clunk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:35:05-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll note that as a separate item so they look at both. Is it in the travel lane?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:35:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, more or less right in the lane where people drive."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:35:24-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. And the drain itself, is it the grate at the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:35:32-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the grate at the curb, right in front of the house. Sometimes there's leaves in it but this time of year it's mostly clear. I took a broom to it once and it didn't change anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:35:54-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So it's probably something down the line, a partial blockage or a pipe issue. That's for the crew to check. They'll want to look at it when it's wet, ideally, but they can still open it up and see."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:36:17-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That makes sense. Do the crews work on weekends? Because I'm usually there Saturday and Sunday, and I could show them if they needed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:36:31-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly they're out weekdays. Weekend work is more for emergencies. You don't need to be there, though. They can find it from the address and my notes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:36:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Good. I just didn't want to hold anything up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:36:54-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you're fine. Let me get a callback number in case someone wants to follow up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:37:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0184."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:37:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0184. Is that a landline?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:37:11-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's a landline. It rings at my place, so if I don't pick up, they can leave a message."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:37:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. And it's under Costa, C-O-S-T-A?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:37:27-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:37:29-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So I've got a slow storm drain at the curb in front of 284 Van Zandt Avenue that backs up on thaws and in dry weather, and a manhole cover nearby that's sitting about an inch high. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:37:54-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's it exactly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:37:57-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I'll send it over to the drainage crew. Usually they get to these within a couple of weeks, depending on what else is on their list. If it's icing over and getting hazardous before then, call me back and I'll flag it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:38:22-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I appreciate that. I'm trying to keep the place in good shape. I'm saving up toward a small condo of my own, so I don't want it to become a bigger problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:38:41-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, makes sense. Well, we'll get somebody out to look. Anything else I can do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:38:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Thank you, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:38:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Costa. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-22T12:39:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
